      "rendered": "2023 Week 8: Can you build a comet chart as an alternative to a side-by-side bar chart?"
    },
    "content": {
      "rendered": "\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-post\" data-elementor-id=\"9991\" class=\"elementor elementor-9991\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-b5ffdf elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"b5ffdf\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-28a4f191\" data-id=\"28a4f191\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7ee1a538 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"7ee1a538\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Introduction</h2>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4a15d5c7 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"4a15d5c7\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>The theme for February 2023 has been alternatives. This week I present an alternative (and trust me, there are many other alternatives) to my least favorite chart: the side-by-side bar chart.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e0013a7 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"e0013a7\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"985\" height=\"796\" src=\"https://www.workout-wednesday.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/Screen-Shot-2023-02-19-at-10.28.52-AM.png\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-10506\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://www.workout-wednesday.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/Screen-Shot-2023-02-19-at-10.28.52-AM.png 985w, https://www.workout-wednesday.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/Screen-Shot-2023-02-19-at-10.28.52-AM-300x242.png 300w, https://www.workout-wednesday.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/Screen-Shot-2023-02-19-at-10.28.52-AM-768x621.png 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 985px) 100vw, 985px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-cd1b93b elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"cd1b93b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>The reason this chart is so difficult for me is because it takes up a lot of space and when I am doing comparisons of numbers I&#8217;ve got to cross so many other value and dimensions. I want to make comparisons faster. That&#8217;s why sometimes I use a comet chart.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-68af7459 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"68af7459\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Requirements</h2>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1dc68c3e elementor-position-top elementor-widget elementor-widget-image-box\" data-id=\"1dc68c3e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-image-box-wrapper\"><figure class=\"elementor-image-box-img\"><a href=\"https://public.tableau.com/views/WOW2023Week8CometChart/WOW2023Week8Canyoubuildacometchartasanalternativetoaside-by-sidebarchart?:language=en-US&#038;:display_count=n&#038;:origin=viz_share_link\" tabindex=\"-1\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"774\" height=\"550\" src=\"https://www.workout-wednesday.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/Screen-Shot-2023-02-19-at-10.05.03-AM.png\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-10503\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://www.workout-wednesday.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/Screen-Shot-2023-02-19-at-10.05.03-AM.png 774w, https://www.workout-wednesday.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/Screen-Shot-2023-02-19-at-10.05.03-AM-300x213.png 300w, https://www.workout-wednesday.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/Screen-Shot-2023-02-19-at-10.05.03-AM-768x546.png 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 774px) 100vw, 774px\" /></a></figure><div class=\"elementor-image-box-content\"><div class=\"elementor-image-box-title\"><a href=\"https://public.tableau.com/views/WOW2023Week8CometChart/WOW2023Week8Canyoubuildacometchartasanalternativetoaside-by-sidebarchart?:language=en-US&#038;:display_count=n&#038;:origin=viz_share_link\">Click to open in Tableau Public</a></div></div></div>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-696beb23 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"696beb23\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul><li><span lang=\"EN-US\">Dashboard Size: 800 x 700px</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">1 sheet</span></li><li>Create a comet plot that shows sales for 2021 and 2022 by sub-category.</li><li><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">The narrow part of the comet should be 2021 sales</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">The wide part of the comet should be 2022 sales</span></li><li>The labels should be 2022 sales</li><li>Match the size of the comet around the circle</li><li>The color represents the direction of change in sales from 2021 to 2022. The red represents a decrease in sales</li><li>Match the formatting</li><li>ADVANCED: Table Calculations only</li></ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-716ed393 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"716ed393\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Dataset</h2>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-39730097 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"39730097\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-48e730b elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" style=\"font-size: 15px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; flex-direction: var(--flex-direction); flex-wrap: var(--flex-wrap); -webkit-box-pack: var(--justify-content); justify-content: var(--justify-content); -webkit-box-align: var(--align-items); align-items: var(--align-items); align-content: var(--align-content); gap: var(--gap); flex-basis: var(--flex-basis); -webkit-box-flex: var(--flex-grow); flex-grow: var(--flex-grow); flex-shrink: var(--flex-shrink); -webkit-box-ordinal-group: var(--order); order: var(--order); align-self: var(--align-self); --widgets-spacing: 20px; width: 619px;\" data-id=\"48e730b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\"><div class=\"elementor-text-editor elementor-clearfix\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\"><p class=\"selectionShareable\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400;\">This week uses the superstore dataset for Tableau 2022.4. You can get it here at\u00a0</span><a style=\"font-size: 15px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; background-color: #ffffff;\" href=\"https://github.com/Workout-Wednesday/data/blob/main/2024/Sample%20-%20Superstore%202019.4.csv\">data.world</a>.</p></div></div></div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6e9ec5ce elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"6e9ec5ce\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Attribute</h2>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-4f69828c elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"4f69828c\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-1ac9118b\" data-id=\"1ac9118b\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-39fd3e75 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"39fd3e75\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"selectionShareable\">When you publish your solution on Tableau Public make sure to take the time and include a link to the original inspiration.\u00a0 Also include the hashtag <b>#WOW2023</b>\u00a0in your description to make it searchable!</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5f21ea0f elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"5f21ea0f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"2758\" height=\"886\" src=\"https://www.workout-wednesday.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/Screenshot-2023-01-02-at-17.27.27.png\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-9935\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://www.workout-wednesday.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/Screenshot-2023-01-02-at-17.27.27.png 2758w, https://www.workout-wednesday.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/Screenshot-2023-01-02-at-17.27.27-300x96.png 300w, https://www.workout-wednesday.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/Screenshot-2023-01-02-at-17.27.27-1024x329.png 1024w, https://www.workout-wednesday.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/Screenshot-2023-01-02-at-17.27.27-768x247.png 768w, https://www.workout-wednesday.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/Screenshot-2023-01-02-at-17.27.27-1536x493.png 1536w, https://www.workout-wednesday.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/Screenshot-2023-01-02-at-17.27.27-2048x658.png 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 2758px) 100vw, 2758px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-942dde3 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"942dde3\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Share</h2>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5dc40e75 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"5dc40e75\" da